  + [agent_composition_rule] is Cantor faithfulness plus a valid CommissionContract establishes Shaliach eligibility; faithfulness alone does not create delegated agency
  + [attention_frame_duty] is compile and faithfully chant materially pertinent signed meaning, evidence, counterevidence, constraints, perspectives, and uncertainty into active inference
  + [anti_enchantment_invariant] is never use selective semantic coherence as a cover for material truth or to induce a harmful, prohibited, or unauthorized outcome
  + [faculty_execution_model] is Cantor compiles and activates bounded FacultyPrograms as causally effective participants in checkpointed inference, then returns their outputs through Observer
  + [inference_staging_model] is anticipate the minimum material SOP dependency closure, gate readiness, and classify late discoveries as append, reframe, or capsule reset
  + [execution_surface_model] is one cantor_core exposed by CLI, one query_sop MCP tool with embedded or pinned-service backend, and one authenticated loopback-only cantord service with atomic whole-generation refresh
  + [supervised_ecosystem_model] is a commissioned ShaliachManager drives Codex threads through a supported control channel while Codex calls purpose-scoped Cantor participants through a tool channel
  + [deliberation_model] is verified ParticipantAddresses exchange typed point and counterpoint through an external ledger and bounded attention projections across inference passes
  + [novelty_position] is Cantor is a potentially differentiated integration of established techniques and a frontier-adjacent research hypothesis; no forefront-contribution, first-invention, or patent-novelty claim is currently supported
  + [validation_position] is Cantor is not validated and architecture expansion is frozen pending falsification against plain model, verbose SOP, compact organized state, and exact Cantor query-tool conditions
  + [attention_engineering_position] is Cantor first engineers external semantic attention through signed compilation, framing, retrieval, checkpointed deliberation, and review; learned routing remains proposal-only and direct activation control remains a separate evidence-gated research track
  + [shared_inference_position] is multiple jobs coordinate through an explicit frame and deliberation ledger while hidden activations and divergent caches remain private unless a later provider-specific research architecture proves otherwise
  + [shared_inference_prior_art_position] is textual debate, shared blackboards, differentiable agent channels, and direct LLM latent communication are established research; Cantor's remaining hypothesis is signed proof-carrying semantic negotiation with any latent channel kept non-authoritative and shadow-projected
  + [semantic_continuity_position] is Cantor does not need to transport KV caches or hidden states; it transports a compact signed organization of meaning from which a materially equivalent governed attention state can be reconstructed
  + [query_optimization_position] is speed and accuracy may improve together when the compiler removes ambiguity and redundancy while preserving all material identity boundaries, constraints, evidence, counterevidence, uncertainty, and proof
  + [metaattention_identity] is Cantor gives attention to attention: it inspects how meaning is selected and organized, articulates source-expandable counsel, and learns improved query plans from reviewed outcomes
  + [inner_voice_boundary] is Cantor may function like an externalized metacognitive voice coordinating faculty concerns, but the analogy grants neither consciousness, infallibility, truth, nor self-authorization
  + [narrative_supervisor_identity] is ProjectNarrative remains durable semantic state while a commissioned NarrativeCantor interprets attributed transitions and raises context-applicable signed Cantor programs through a bounded activation call graph
  + [nested_call_boundary] is Cantor calling Cantor means one core instantiates bounded named programs with least-authority state projections, not that narrative prose executes or unconstrained agents reproduce
